sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer
    participant FE as React booking page
    participant PC as ParcelController
    participant PS as ParcelService
    participant PR as PricingService (M4)
    participant TG as TrackingNumberGenerator
    participant SS as ParcelStatusService (M5)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ

    Note over C,MQ: Step 1 - fill the form, see the fee first
    C->>FE: Enter addresses, receiver, size (S/M/L), weight
    FE->>PR: POST /api/v1/pricing/quote {pickupDistrict, dropoffDistrict, size, weightKg}
    PR-->>FE: 200 {fee, pickupZone, dropoffZone, interZone}
    FE-->>C: Show fee preview

    Note over C,MQ: Step 2 - confirm the booking (one transaction)
    C->>FE: Click Confirm
    FE->>PC: POST /api/v1/parcels (JWT, body validated with @Valid)
    PC->>PS: createParcel(request, customerId from JWT)
    PS->>PR: calculateQuote(QuoteRequest)
    PR-->>PS: QuoteResponse (fee)
    PS->>TG: generate()
    TG-->>PS: trackingNumber (SD + 10 chars)
    PS->>DB: INSERT parcels (status = CREATED, fee, trackingNumber)
    DB-->>PS: saved Parcel
    PS->>SS: recordCreated(parcel, "CUSTOMER", userId)
    SS->>DB: INSERT status_history (old = null, new = CREATED)
    SS->>SS: raise ParcelStatusChangedEvent (oldStatus = null)
    PS-->>PC: ParcelResponse (DTO)
    PC-->>FE: 201 Created + tracking number
    FE-->>C: Show tracking number

    Note over SS,MQ: After the database commit only
    SS-)MQ: publish parcel.status.changed (notification + webhook queues, WebSocket push)

    alt Validation fails (missing field, bad phone, weight <= 0)
        PC-->>FE: 400 error JSON {timestamp, status, code, message, path}
        FE-->>C: Show field errors
    end
